5:["$","$L17",null,{"divisions":[{"id":"research","slug":"research","name":"$4:props:data:divisions:0:name","sub":{"en":"Research & Academic Support","ne":"अनुसन्धान र शैक्षिक सहयोग"},"desc":{"en":"Research support from topic selection to viva preparation, with responsible academic-quality review.","ne":"विषय छनोटदेखि भाइभा तयारीसम्म अनुसन्धान सहयोग, जिम्मेवार शैक्षिक गुणस्तर समीक्षासहित।"},"route":"/research","color":"#35e0ff","icon":"compass","art":"research","order":1,"visible":true,"status":"published"},{"id":"entertainment","slug":"entertainment","name":"$4:props:data:divisions:1:name","sub":{"en":"Stories & Digital Media","ne":"कथा र डिजिटल मिडिया"},"desc":{"en":"AI stories, comedy, drama, horror, short films, music and cinematic work from the Acttolog world.","ne":"एआई कथा, कमेडी, ड्रामा, हरर, छोटो चलचित्र, संगीत र सिनेमाटिक सामग्री।"},"route":"/entertainment","color":"#ff4ecd","icon":"play","art":"stage","order":2,"visible":true,"status":"published"},{"id":"academy","slug":"academy","name":"$4:props:data:divisions:2:name","sub":{"en":"Learning & Knowledge","ne":"सिकाइ र ज्ञान"},"desc":{"en":"Courses, modules, lessons and resources on research, economics, finance, statistics, technology and AI.","ne":"अनुसन्धान, अर्थशास्त्र, वित्त, तथ्याङ्क, प्रविधि र एआईका पाठ्यक्रम र स्रोतहरू।"},"route":"/academy","color":"#7c5cff","icon":"book","art":"academy","order":3,"visible":true,"status":"published"},{"id":"games","slug":"games","name":"$4:props:data:divisions:3:name","sub":{"en":"Interactive Experiences","ne":"अन्तरक्रियात्मक अनुभव"},"desc":{"en":"Browser games, mini games, educational play and experimental interactive experiences.","ne":"ब्राउजर खेल, मिनी खेल, शैक्षिक खेल र प्रयोगात्मक अनुभव।"},"route":"/games","color":"#3ddc97","icon":"game","art":"games","order":4,"visible":true,"status":"published"},{"id":"darkroom","slug":"darkroom","name":"$4:props:data:divisions:4:name","sub":{"en":"Digital Discovery & Resources","ne":"डिजिटल खोज र स्रोत"},"desc":{"en":"A verified discovery hub for official websites, tools, databases and hard-to-find resources.","ne":"आधिकारिक वेबसाइट, औजार, डाटाबेस र दुर्लभ स्रोतको प्रमाणित खोज केन्द्र।"},"route":"/darkroom","color":"#f5c26b","icon":"search","art":"editorial","order":5,"visible":true,"status":"published"}]}]
19:T4e5,Most rejected proposals fail in the same place: the research question. Not because the topic is uninteresting, but because the question is unanswerable, unmeasurable, or already answered.

## Topic, problem, question

A topic is a subject area. A problem is a tension inside that area — something unresolved, contradictory or unmeasured. A question is a specific, testable formulation of that tension.

- Topic: remote work and productivity.
- Problem: studies disagree on the direction and size of the effect.
- Question: under which task types does remote work change measured output for knowledge workers?

## Three filters

1. **Reachability** — can you obtain the data, sample or documents within your timeframe?
2. **Measurability** — is there a defensible operational definition for each construct?
3. **Contribution** — if answered, does something change for a reader, a policy or a field?

> A question that passes two filters is a chapter. A question that passes three is a thesis.

## Then reverse-engineer the method

Once the question is fixed, the methodology writes itself: the design follows the question type, the sample follows the population, the analysis follows the construct definitions. That is the order reviewers expect.6:["$","$L18",null,{"data":{"shots":["world","research","darkroom","academy","entertainment","games"],"sections":{"nepal":{"id":"nepal","title":{"en":"Nepal — the country ACTTOLOG calls home","ne":"नेपाल — एक्टोलगको आफ्नै देश"},"body":{"en":"Eight of the world's fourteen peaks above 8,000 metres, UNESCO World Heritage sites from the valley to the high Himalaya, and a festival in almost every week of the year. ACTTOLOG maps the regions, places, cultures, treks and travel rules of Nepal in one interactive guide — free, bilingual, and written for people who actually intend to go.","ne":"संसारका १४ अठ्ठहजारी शिखरमध्ये आठ, उपत्यकादेखि उच्च हिमालयसम्मका युनेस्को विश्व सम्पदा स्थल, र प्रायः हरेक हप्तामा कुनै न कुनै चाड। एक्टोलगले नेपालका क्षेत्र, स्थान, संस्कृति, ट्रेक र यात्रा नियम एकै अन्तरक्रियात्मक मार्गदर्शनमा झिकेको छ — निःशुल्क, द्विभाषी।"},"visible":true},"intro":{"id":"intro","title":{"en":"One world. Five divisions. A single connected system.","ne":"एउटै संसार। पाँच विभाग। एक जोडिएको प्रणाली।"},"body":{"en":"Acttolog connects research, entertainment, learning, play and discovery so an idea can begin as a question, become a lesson, ship as media or a game, and stay supplied with verified tools.","ne":"Acttolog ले अनुसन्धान, मनोरञ्जन, सिकाइ, खेल र खोजलाई जोड्छ — ताकि एउटा विचार प्रश्नबाट सुरु भई पाठ बन्न, मिडिया वा खेल बन्न र प्रमाणित औजारले भरिइरहन सकोस्।"},"visible":true},"eco":{"id":"eco","title":{"en":"The Acttolog Orbital Ecosystem","ne":"Acttolog अर्बिटल इकोसिस्टम"},"body":{"en":"Five divisions orbit one world. Select a node to enter.","ne":"पाँच विभाग एउटै संसारको परिक्रमा गर्छन्। प्रवेश गर्न नोड छान्नुहोस्।"},"visible":true},"divisions":{"id":"divisions","title":{"en":"Inside the divisions","ne":"विभागहरू भित्र"},"body":{"en":"Each division stands alone and connects to the others.","ne":"प्रत्येक विभाग स्वतन्त्र छ र अरूसँग जोडिन्छ।"},"visible":true},"featured":{"id":"featured","title":{"en":"Featured in the World","ne":"संसारका विशेष सामग्री"},"body":{"en":"Curated from the Acttolog content library.","ne":"Acttolog सामग्री पुस्तकालयबाट छानिएको।"},"visible":true},"latest":{"id":"latest","title":{"en":"Latest across the ecosystem","ne":"इकोसिस्टमका नवीनतम सामग्री"},"body":{"en":"Blog, research, entertainment and discovery updates.","ne":"ब्लग, अनुसन्धान, मनोरञ्जन र खोज अपडेट।"},"visible":true},"academy":{"id":"academy","title":{"en":"Acttolog Academy","ne":"Acttolog एकेडेमी"},"body":{"en":"Structured learning built from research practice.","ne":"अनुसन्धान अभ्यासबाट बनेको संरचित सिकाइ।"},"visible":true},"darkroom":{"id":"darkroom","title":{"en":"Darkroom","ne":"डार्करूम"},"body":{"en":"Verified tools, databases and hard-to-find resources.","ne":"प्रमाणित औजार, डाटाबेस र दुर्लभ स्रोतहरू।"},"visible":true},"offers":{"id":"offers","title":{"en":"Offers","ne":"अफरहरू"},"body":{"en":"Selected commercial opportunities across divisions.","ne":"विभागभरिका छानिएका व्यावसायिक अवसर।"},"visible":true},"about":{"id":"about","title":{"en":"About Acttolog","ne":"Acttolog बारेमा"},"body":{"en":"Purpose, vision, mission and the values behind the world.","ne":"उद्देश्य, दृष्टिकोण, लक्ष्य र मूल्यहरू।"},"visible":true},"cta":{"id":"cta","title":{"en":"Enter the Acttolog World","ne":"Acttolog संसारमा प्रवेश गर्नुहोस्"},"body":{"en":"Discover. Learn. Create. Connect.","ne":"खोज्नुहोस्। सिक्नुहोस्। सिर्जना गर्नुहोस्। जोडिनुहोस्।"},"visible":true}},"settings":"$0:data:0:rsc:props:children:0:props:children:1:0:props:settings","divisions":"$5:props:divisions","counts":"$4:props:data:counts","featured":{"post":{"id":"p_research-question-that-survives-review","slug":"research-question-that-survives-review","title":{"en":"Designing a Research Question That Survives Review","ne":"समीक्षा टिक्ने अनुसन्धान प्रश्न कसरी बनाउने"},"excerpt":{"en":"A research question is not a topic. It is a claim about what is unknown, why it matters, and how it can be answered with the data you can actually reach.","ne":"अनुसन्धान प्रश्न विषय होइन। यो के अज्ञात छ, किन महत्त्वपूर्ण छ, र कुन डाटाले उत्तर दिन सकिन्छ भन्ने दाबी हो।"},"content":{"en":"$19","ne":"धेरैजसो अस्वीकृत प्रस्ताव एउटै ठाउँमा असफल हुन्छन्: अनुसन्धान प्रश्न। विषय कमजोर भएकोले होइन, प्रश्न अनुत्तरणीय, अपरिमेय वा पहिल्यै उत्तरित भएकोले।\n\n## विषय, समस्या, प्रश्न\n\nविषय एउटा क्षेत्र हो। समस्या त्यस क्षेत्रभित्रको तनाव हो। प्रश्न त्यस तनावको विशिष्ट र परीक्षणयोग्य रूप हो।\n\n## तीन फिल्टर\n\n1. **पहुँच** — तोकिएको समयमा डाटा वा नमूना प्राप्त गर्न सकिन्छ?\n2. **मापनयोग्यता** — प्रत्येक कन्स्ट्रक्टको रक्षा गर्न सकिने परिभाषा छ?\n3. **योगदान** — उत्तर मिलेमा पाठक, नीति वा क्षेत्रमा केही परिवर्तन हुन्छ?\n\n> दुई फिल्टर पास गर्ने प्रश्न एउटा अध्याय हो। तीनै पास गर्ने प्रश्न थेसिस हो।"},"cover":"art:research","author":"Acttolog Editorial","category":"Research","tags":["methodology","proposal","thesis"],"publishedAt":"2026-09-17","updatedAt":"","status":"published","access":"public","audience":"global","featured":true,"seoTitle":"Designing a Research Question That Survives Review","seoDescription":"A research question is not a topic. It is a claim about what is unknown, why it matters, and how it can be answered with the data you can actually reach.","socialImage":""},"offer":{"id":"o2","slug":"thesyn-gold","division":"research","title":"$4:props:data:offer:title","short":"$4:props:data:offer:short","desc":{"en":"Planning, analysis and writing structure across the whole project, with analysis files handed over at the end.","ne":"परियोजनाभर योजना, विश्लेषण र लेखन संरचना, अन्त्यमा विश्लेषण फाइल हस्तान्तरणसहित।"},"npr":30000,"usd":225,"mode":"both","features":[{"en":"Multi-chapter scope","ne":"बहु-अध्याय कार्यक्षेत्र"},{"en":"Data analysis and diagnostics","ne":"डाटा विश्लेषण र डायग्नोस्टिक्स"},{"en":"Three revision cycles","ne":"तीन संशोधन चक्र"},{"en":"Scheduled r